Z||000008||ThatRickGuy||06-15-2001||02:10 PM||||I'm running the Ocelot 2in performance exhaust w/ a cat eliminator pipe. good construction, except that stupid y-pipe flang you need to file. The sound is much louder (on a 3.2) but the shuttleworth muffler is a bit more 'fu-fu' then I wanted, it sounds like a ricer w/ some balls at idle and light acceleration, at WOT it takes on a much meaner sound. I'd probrably see about getting a flowmaster on it vice the shuttleworth to keep the tone lower.||||reg||1
